apachetop for Debian
================================

This package contains the apachetop scoreboard monitor.

The tool is intended to run on the same host as Apache httpd and reads
the Apache scoreboard directly from /dev/shm/ShM.*.

Apache must have mod_status loaded and ExtendedStatus On.

The GitHub CI build also tests the binary against Debian 12 and Debian 13
with the Apache prefork MPM.

Versioning
----------

The application version follows Semantic Versioning and is reported by
`apachetop --version`. Debian package versions use epoch 1 to avoid being
considered older than a distro package with the same name.
